  "question": {
    "text": "When \\(\\Delta \\mathrm{H}_{\\mathrm{vap}}=30 \\mathrm{~kJ} / \\mathrm{mol}\\) and \\(\\Delta \\mathrm{S}_{\\mathrm{vap}}=75 \\mathrm{~J} \\mathrm{~mol}^{-1} \\mathrm{~K}^{-1}\\), then the temperature of vapour, at one atmosphere is ______ \\(\\mathrm{K}\\).",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "400",
  "solution": {
    "text": "At equilibrium $\\Delta \\mathrm{G}_{\\mathrm{PT}}=0$\n$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\Delta \\mathrm{H}_{\\text {vap }}=\\mathrm{T} \\Delta \\mathrm{S}_{\\text {vap }} \\\\\n& 30 \\times 1000=\\mathrm{T} \\times 75 \\\\\n& \\mathrm{~T}=400 \\mathrm{~K}\n\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
  },
